# Provisional application period for fishing opportunities.

```catala
declaration scope ProvisionalApplicationPeriod:
  input start_date content date
  input end_date content date
  output period_duration content duration
```

## The period covers the time from the start date to the end date.

```catala
scope ProvisionalApplicationPeriod:
  date round down
  definition period_duration equals end_date - start_date
```